Package: com.stevenjc.ios6revival.cacheclean
Name: Clear Caches
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Settings > Clear Caches has a Clear button that deletes Maps tiles, the pictures shown while apps open, and ad caches. The phone rebuilds them as it is used.
